  <completion>Done 2026-11-25: PR #3141 squash-merged to master (423cfc67f7, Closes #2814) after a main-session review. The open effect now dispatches the existing RESET instead of GO_TO_STEP+clearSkipped, so a reopened wizard starts from its static steps on step 1 with no skipped marks; no new action, prop or component. Every addDynamicStep host checked: DecisionItemWizard re-syncs on [key, steps] (and never reopens), FollowOnGrid hosts clear their selection on close. The shell reopen test fails on master; reducer tests are controls (RESET already worked; deviation recorded). Console auto-deploys from master.</completion>
